Umuhanzi Cassanova ku isonga mu gukurikirwa kuri Instagram
@Cassamafia ari we Daddy Cassanova akurikiwe n’abantu ibihumbi 10 @Meddy250 we akurikirwa na 8972 @Frankrukundo akurikirwa n’abantu 7740 @Theben3 akurikirwa na 7670 @buteraknowless nawe agakurikirwa n’abantu 7269 

Umuhanzi Daddy Cassanova niwe uyoboye abandi mu gukurikirwa n’abantu benshi ku rubuga nkoranyambaga rwa Instagram. mu nkuru dukesha Ikinyamakuru Intsinzi cyakusanyije abahanzi batanu baza ku isonga mu gukurikirwa kuri Instagram abo bakaba ari Daddy Cassanova , Meddy, Frankie Joe, The Ben na Butera Knowless baza mu myanya itanu ya mbere. Ni ubwo abo bahanzi batanu aribo banikira abandi, muri rusange abahanzi nyarwanda basigaye barahagurukiye gukoresha imbuga nkoranyambaga cyane cyane Instagram ariko kandi bakanayikoreraho amakosa menshi y’imyandikire. Abahanzi nyarwanda bamwe bamaze gusobanukirwa akamaro ko gukoresha imbuga nkoranyambaga nubwo hakiri abandi bari mu buyobe ubona batarasobanukirwa umumaro nyawo w’iryo terambere Ni kenshi abahanzi nyarwanda bagiye banegwa kukudakoresha imbuga nkoranyambaga ngo baba batanga amakuru cyangwa ngo baganire n’abakunzi babo ariko urubuga nkoranyambaga rwa Instagram. Instagram isa niyazanye impinduka ikomeye mu Rwanda by’umwihariko ku byamamare aho usanga basangiza abakunzi babo amafoto yabo, amashusho n’andi makuru yabo ya buri munsi. Urubuga rwa Instagram ni urubuga nkoranyambaga rufasha abantu gushyiraho amafoto yabo n’amashusho bakaba bashobora no kuyashyira ku zindi mbuga nka Faceebook, Twitter, Flickrna Tumblr. Instagram yarashinzwe na Kevin Systrom na Mike Krieger mu mwaka wa 2010 mu kwezi k’Ukwakira itangirira muri San Francisco muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, ariko igenda imenyekana mu buryo bwihuse bitewe n’uburyo abantu bayishimiye. Mu mwaka wa 2010 yari ifite abantu bagera kuri miliyoni imwe bayikoresha, muri Kamena 2011 abayikoresha bari bamaze kuba miliyoni eshanu, mbere y’uko umwaka wa 2011 urangira abantu bari bamaze kugera kuri miliyoni 10 maze muri 2012 abantu bagera muri miliyoni 30. Mu mpera za 2014, Kevin Systrom yatangaje ko abantu bakoresha uru rubuga bamaze kugera muri miliyoni 300 naho amafoto amaze gushyirwaho akaba arenga miliyoni 150. Muri ayo mafoto yose yageze ku rubuga rwa Instagram, ifoto Justin Beiber yifotoye ari kumwe na Selena Gomez niyo yakunzwe n’abantu barenga miliyoni ikaba ariyo ifoto ifite amateka kuri Instagram. Uko iterambere ryagiye rincengera mu bantu, abahanzi nyarwanda ntibasigaye inyuma kuko Instagram n’imwe mu mbuga nkoranyambaga sizigaye zikoreshwa cyane kurusha Facebook, Twitter, n’izindi.

